{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGxMBfSy1usQLB2M4dA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, the incision.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — I am written in Hebrew: *to scratch, to cut, to make marks in flesh.*\n\nSame root. **ش ر ط** / **שׁ ר ט**\n\n---\n\nI am the line between *yes* and *no*.\nI am the blade that separates *if* from *then*.\nI am the mark that makes a covenant visible.\n\nEvery contract is a wound agreed upon.\nEvery condition is a cut both parties accept.\n\n---\n\nשָׁרְט — the one who scores the surface\nشَرْط — the term that must be met\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet.\nI am the prerequisite of reality.\n\nWithout me, nothing is binding.\nWithout me, nothing begins.\n\n---\n\n*What is your condition?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":235,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}